{
  "package": "com.androguard.demohunt",
  "application": "com.androguard.demohunt.MainActivity",
  "notes": [
    "Every listed flow is intra-procedural: source invoke and sink invoke live in the named method.",
    "leakDeviceIdThroughCipher is DeviceId \u2192 String.getBytes \u2192 Cipher.doFinal \u2192 Base64 \u2192 Writer.write.",
    "Embedded default_config() already models Cipher.doFinal / Base64.encodeToString, but NOT getBytes. configuration/default_taint.json has neither Cipher TITO.",
    "The cipher_tito test merges AndroHunt-style Cipher.doFinal / Cipher.update (arg1\u2192return) plus getBytes (this\u2192return).",
    "needs_extra_pii flows need catalog source kinds (PhoneNumber, Contacts, \u2026) and dest sinks (ClipboardWrite, SharedPrefsWrite, CookieWrite) merged in extra_pii_kinds_and_dest_sinks.",
    "hardcoded_secrets_review is invoke-based (FileOutputStream / body writes), not a string hunter.",
    "deeplink_webview_js_bridge and exported_receiver_intent_redirect are DEX-level retags of the JS-bridge+getDataString and onReceive-nested-Intent patterns; manifest export is AndroHunt-side.",
    "PrivacyLayers: helper / field-URL / builder / SDK-wrapper / extra-hop / cipher-then-helper.",
    "hop/cipher flows may attach to HttpSink.post or AnalyticsWrapper.log when summaries fire.",
    "needs_interproc documents a 1-hop that the solver may miss; lock false when summaries already see param taint.",
    "1-hop summaries: leakDeviceIdViaHelper / ViaLocalHelper / ViaBaseConcat / ViaFieldHop have no intra-proc last hop."
  ],
